Skip launcher tests that require an Isaac Lab source checkout.

The test_launcher_* cases copy the real isaaclab.sh launcher, which only exists
in a source checkout and is not shipped by the installed (wheel/conda) package.
Request the existing source_checkout_root session fixture (added upstream in
isaac-sim/IsaacLab#7389) so the tests auto-skip against an installed package,
and use the returned checkout path instead of the installed package root.
Upstreamable as-is.
